### Create a study group
POST http://localhost:8080/api/study-groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CSC326 Study Group",
  "description": "Study group for CSC326 project and exam prep",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1,
  "createdByUserId": 1,
  "maxSize": 5,
  "studyMode": "In-person",
  "meetingLocation": "Hunt Library",
  "meetingTimes": "Friday 5 PM",
  "meetingDurationMinutes": 90
}


### Get members of study group 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/study-groups/1/members


### Add user 3 to study group 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/study-groups/1/members/3

### Remove user 3 from study group 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/study-groups/1/members/3

### Create join request - User 3 wants to join Group 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/join-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3,
  "studyGroupId": 1,
  "message": "I would like to join this study group."
}

### Accept join request 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/join-requests/1/accept

### Create request for reject test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/join-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 4,
  "studyGroupId": 1,
  "message": "Testing reject."
}

### Reject join request 2
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/join-requests/2/reject

### Create request for cancel test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/join-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 4,
  "studyGroupId": 1,
  "message": "Testing cancel."
}

### Cancel join request 3
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/join-requests/3/cancel

### Sign up a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Authentication Test",
  "email": "authtest@ncsu.edu",
  "ncsuId": "authtest",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Login with correct credentials
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "authtest@ncsu.edu",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Login with incorrect password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "authtest@ncsu.edu",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}


### Try duplicate signup
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate User",
  "email": "authtest@ncsu.edu",
  "ncsuId": "differentid",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Save preferences for user 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "availability": "Monday and Wednesday 6-8 PM",
  "studyStyle": "Practice Problems",
  "preferredGroupSize": 4,
  "studyMode": "In Person",
  "additionalNotes": "I prefer studying before exams."
}

### Save preferences for user 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/preferences
### Save preferences for user 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/study-groups

### Pujit sends message to CSC326 group
POST http://localhost:8080/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studyGroupId": 1,
  "senderId": 1,
  "content": "Hey everyone! When should we meet to study?"
}

### Get CSC326 group messages
GET http://localhost:8080/api/messages/group/1

### Test Student replies
POST http://localhost:8080/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studyGroupId": 1,
  "senderId": 2,
  "content": "Tuesday evening works for me!"
}

### Get conversation
GET http://localhost:8080/api/messages/group/1

### Debug user's study groups
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/study-groups